{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Horror Factor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dead Exhale has been developed from the ground up with one of the most advanced monster A.I.'s ever made. Specifically designed to not only hunt the player but toy with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/extras/Gif1deadexhale-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1750951521\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hold Your Breath</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Other games have had things involving breath, but never in real life. Dead Exhale relies on you activating anomalies with your inhale and exhale. You'll need to hold your breath and keep a cool head to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/extras/Gif2deadexhale-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1750951521\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Puzzles and Lore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With everything you discover you'll have environmental story telling. No notes to slow you down, only real voice actors and thousands of years of lore written into a single experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/extras/Gif3deadexhale-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1750951521\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Perfectly Designed For Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Especially catered and created to utilize retention for videos and streams, this is the next evolution of horror games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3305120?t=1750951521","background_raw":"ht